WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.570
Good morning John, 
let's go to the warehouse to get my Pizzamas stuff! 

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:15.079
[Instrumental music] 

00:00:15.112 --> 00:00:19.649
The team at DFTDA has been working their butts off 
for months getting ready for this

00:00:19.649 --> 00:00:21.518
I cannot believe they pulled 
some of these things off

00:00:21.518 --> 00:00:24.386
When a Pizza John Chia Pet was 
proposed to me, I said

00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:28.657
that's a fun idea y 'all, 
but we're not going to be able to make it happen

00:00:28.657 --> 00:00:29.891
And yet!

00:00:29.891 --> 00:00:31.959
It is a very pretty day in Missoula, Montana

00:00:31.959 --> 00:00:33.994
If they could all be like this, everybody would live here

00:00:34.027 --> 00:00:37.030
[beep beeps]

00:00:37.063 --> 00:00:38.064
Just kidding

00:00:38.064 --> 00:00:46.571
[Instrumental music] 

00:00:46.571 --> 00:00:49.273
And now I've got my box!

00:00:49.306 --> 00:00:51.741
It's just a lot of enthusiasm 
for Pizza John, John

00:00:51.741 --> 00:00:53.543
It never... it does not decrease!

00:00:53.543 --> 00:00:58.347
Now I have Pizza John stuff, 
it's time to go home and give myself a mustache!

00:00:58.347 --> 00:01:02.083
Going bald and then having your hair grow back 
and suddenly getting facial hair

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:06.887
Seeing my, my face in the mirror in a 
bunch of different ways like I'm a totally different person

00:01:06.887 --> 00:01:09.856
I saw a comment on TikTok that said, 
and Green went from,

00:01:09.889 --> 00:01:12.892
uh... from enthusiastic TA to 

00:01:12.892 --> 00:01:15.594
grizzled tenured professor 
in two months!

00:01:15.627 --> 00:01:16.861
and yeah, I feel that

00:01:16.861 --> 00:01:18.930
It's just made me very confident 
in a way that like,

00:01:18.963 --> 00:01:20.965
I'm not, like, I don't have to 
be like a way

00:01:20.965 --> 00:01:22.466
I looked one way for so long

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:24.934
 I've had some looks over the years, 
some of them I don't feel great about

00:01:24.934 --> 00:01:25.935
Like that while I mix it up!

00:01:25.935 --> 00:01:28.804
I had a Mohawk for a little while
and now I'm going to have a mustache!

00:01:28.804 --> 00:01:32.040
How is that going to go? 
There's no way to know!

00:01:32.974 --> 00:01:35.409
I can't believe I'm saying 
goodbye to my first beard

00:01:35.443 --> 00:01:42.048
[Instrumental music]

00:01:42.048 --> 00:01:45.818
That's goatee me 
This is what goatee Hank looks like now

00:01:45.818 --> 00:01:48.019
Ah, I think he looks fine

00:01:48.053 --> 00:01:50.421
Who is that guy? Who is that guy? 

00:01:50.421 --> 00:01:51.889
That's a different guy!

00:01:51.889 --> 00:01:53.757
Freakin' Walter White over here

00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:55.559
I think I may be the one who knocks!

00:01:55.592 --> 00:01:59.895
[Instrumental music]

00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:02.297
I suppose that's a look

00:02:02.297 --> 00:02:04.699
It's a look that some people could have

00:02:04.733 --> 00:02:07.602
I'm excited to not have it honestly
There was so much hair

00:02:07.602 --> 00:02:14.907
[music]

00:02:15.841 --> 00:02:18.844
 I feel like we found ourselves at 
sort of a classic pizza John here

00:02:18.844 --> 00:02:21.980
Uh, where the mustache keeps 
going down for a little while

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:24.548
just like peak ridiculousness, but

00:02:24.582 --> 00:02:26.483
I think I'm gonna clean mine up

00:02:26.483 --> 00:02:30.086
I think that's yours John, 
but what's mine?

00:02:30.086 --> 00:02:32.154
Ahhhhh!

00:02:32.188 --> 00:02:35.357
Hank: Good? 
Katherine: Oh yeah, I mean it's a look

00:02:36.158 --> 00:02:37.357
Oh, yeah! 

00:02:37.357 --> 00:03:33.003
[music]

00:03:33.103 --> 00:03:36.839
Happy Pizzamas, John 
from whoever the heck this guy is

00:03:36.839 --> 00:03:39.508
I'm looking at him right now...

00:03:39.508 --> 00:03:40.806
I don't know?

00:03:40.806 --> 00:03:41.306
He's that guy!

00:03:41.306 --> 00:03:42.677
He's me!

00:03:42.677 --> 00:03:43.644
What's me?

00:03:43.644 --> 00:03:45.145
John, I'll see you tomorrow

